  "remarks": "TAi.052 Title: Maulavi. Designation: Head of Bakhtar Information Agency (BIA) under the Taliban regime. Member of Taliban Cultural Commission. Directs a Taliban \"front\" and coordinates all military activities of Taliban forces in Maiwand District, Kandahar Province, Afghanistan as of mid-2013. Believed to be in Afghanistan/Pakistan border area. Belongs to Kharoti (Taraki) tribe. Review pursuant to Security Council resolution 1822 (2008) was concluded on 23 Jul. 2010.; Listing: Listed on 23 February 2001 (amended on 21 Sep 2007, 29 Nov. 2011, 1 Jun. 2012 and 31 Dec. 2013)",
